1
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,897
Destiny. Fate. Dreams.

2
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:21,140
These unstoppable ideals are
held deep in the heart of man.

3
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:24,937
As long as there are people
who seek freedom in this life,

4
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,667
these things shall not
vanish from the earth.

5
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,517
People tell me my head's in the clouds.

6
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:40,877
I don't care what they say
because I'm dreaming of you.

7
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,557
You are the treasure I found.

8
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:46,657
So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.

9
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:48,737
It's hard to look away.

10
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:51,857
Even though it's blinding me.

11
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:55,697
There are no words to
describe how I feel inside.

12
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:58,020
I'm really, really stuck on you.

13
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:02,537
I have to follow my dreams,
however crazy they seem.

14
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,597
And I won't stop till I
get there, you will see.

15
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:08,897
You're all I need to have
the strength to believe.

16
00:01:08,980 --> 00:01:12,520
Believe in wonderland.

17
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:21,097
I'm gonna follow my dreams,
however crazy they seem.

18
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:24,157
I'm gonna share them
with you, a love so true.

19
00:01:24,240 --> 00:01:27,557
You're all I want,
together we can move on.

20
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,917
We live how we want to.

21
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,037
There is no limit to us.

22
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,557
We have the power of love.

23
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:36,617
We don't wanna live ordinary life.

24
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:39,697
We have a chance to live in paradise.

25
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:42,480
We live in one another.

26
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:04,060
Are you all right?

27
00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:09,420
Koza! Are you okay?

28
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:12,780
I'm fine. Are you sure?

29
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,337
That bullet from Nanohana is still in you.

30
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:16,891
None of that matters now.

31
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:18,777
This is a battlefield we're on.

32
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:21,317
We have to stay focused
on what's happening.

33
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,230
Got that?

34
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,777
I'd like to get to one of their horses.

35
00:02:24,860 --> 00:02:27,817
If we can make our way down this
street and through the center of town,

36
00:02:27,900 --> 00:02:31,371
then we'll be at the North
Block where the Royal Palace is.

37
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,077
What are you planning, Koza?

38
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,460
Why go to the palace?

39
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:39,220
To reach the king and demand
that he surrender to us.

40
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,440
But that's insane.

41
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:43,537
The main force of the Royal Army
is stationed in the North Block,

42
00:02:43,620 --> 00:02:45,957
and what's more, they're
led by Chaka and Pell.

43
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,077
Think of the danger.

44
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:50,557
And we haven't even managed to
gather all of our forces together.

45
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:52,657
Don't you think it would
be a better idea to wait?

46
00:02:52,740 --> 00:02:55,037
Until reinforcements
arrive here to help we

47
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:59,620
can't it's already too
late for that now come on!

48
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,320
Wait Koza.

49
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,877
Holt are you aligned with the rebel army?

50
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:22,097
The only thing ahead of here in the
north block is the royal palace.

51
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:24,417
Do you understand me?

52
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:29,237
If you aren't a part of the battle
leave this area of town at once!

53
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:31,257
Hey are you listening?

54
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:32,957
This place is no playground.

55
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:33,870
You get it.

56
00:03:33,953 --> 00:03:35,600
I know that.

57
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:41,720
Princess Vivi it can't
be is it really her?

58
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:46,097
Where's my father?

59
00:03:46,180 --> 00:03:48,297
I need him now. Princess.

60
00:03:48,380 --> 00:03:50,120
Oh never mind.

61
00:03:51,100 --> 00:03:53,397
If I can't see him then take me to Chaka.

62
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:57,340
There's something that he must do.

63
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,760
You bastard.

64
00:04:25,600 --> 00:04:27,060
That was quite a kick.

65
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:30,420
This one can compete with
my ballet kenpo moves.

66
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:32,930
You!

67
00:04:33,013 --> 00:04:34,000
Out of my way!

68
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:38,237
I already told you, if you want to get
by, you'll have to defeat me first.

69
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:41,380
I hope you realize all your
efforts will be in vain.

70
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:44,680
All my life I have
practiced these dance moves.

71
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:47,477
I have perfected the dancer's
grateful art of ballet

72
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:50,277
Kenpo and it is unbeatable
even by the likes of...

73
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,190
Yeah!

74
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:57,460
Just give up, it's no
use trying to escape!

75
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,840
Ballet Kenpo!

76
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:18,100
I Degenerate Swan Death Recycle!

77
00:05:25,720 --> 00:05:27,577
This dance isn't getting me anywhere!

78
00:05:27,660 --> 00:05:30,131
It's time to settle this once and for all!

79
00:05:32,640 --> 00:05:34,020
Col-Yay Shoot!

80
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:36,160
Hit me!

81
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:38,960
Complete!

82
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,800
Set!

83
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,420
On three!

84
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:46,130
Yeah!

85
00:05:47,340 --> 00:05:49,280
Ballet get ball!

86
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,140
Automate shoot!

87
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:55,640
Not a pass!

88
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:18,180
My mortine chute, blocked by that clown.

89
00:06:19,820 --> 00:06:23,996
My ultimate swan at a vest, stopped
by that stupid, insignificant cook.

90
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:27,761
You've got to be kidding me here.

91
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,077
Okay, it's time to get serious.

92
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,317
From now on, I mean business.

93
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:33,282
Do you hear me?

94
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:34,978
Let's see it, then.

95
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:40,020
You don't know the true extent
of my power yet, do you?

96
00:06:40,740 --> 00:06:44,157
My most impressive feature is
my ability to remember faces.

97
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:47,887
Using that, I can construct and
display an incredible montage!

98
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:52,545
When you see this, you will laugh
helplessly until you collapse!

99
00:06:54,460 --> 00:06:57,260
To begin, the world's
most ridiculous head!

100
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:00,320
Then the world's most ridiculous eyes!

101
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,917
The most ridiculous nose!

102
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:06,300
and in the world's most ridiculous mouth.

103
00:07:07,020 --> 00:07:09,140
Now take a good long look,

104
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:14,480
experience the grand unveiling
of the Cape Cape Montage.

105
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:28,400
About 90 % of that was
your own ridiculous face.

106
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:31,960
I'll help you.

107
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,117
Stop playing dress-up, you ugly freak.

108
00:07:35,200 --> 00:07:36,197
Don't you have a heart?

109
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:38,660
I'm a brilliant artist, you big jerk.

110
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:43,597
I don't have time to mess around with
your childish little tricks anymore.

111
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,510
Tricks, huh?

112
00:07:44,593 --> 00:07:45,423
Not so fast.

113
00:07:46,220 --> 00:07:47,237
They aren't just tricks.

114
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,732
Just wait until you see.

115
00:07:49,100 --> 00:07:49,977
Within my art,

116
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:53,517
there lies the power of the greatest
friendships and the truest loves.

117
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,620
Right, I get it.

118
00:07:55,260 --> 00:07:56,817
I see what you're planning now.

119
00:07:56,900 --> 00:07:59,597
We all need love, and friends,
friends are so important.

120
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,497
It really just isn't
going to work, though.

121
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:03,460
Now, let's see you hurt me. No!

122
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:06,960
How could you do that?

123
00:08:07,180 --> 00:08:09,757
You just attacked your little
friend with a long nose.

124
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:13,369
Well, then, clearly you don't
value friendship much, do you?

125
00:08:13,940 --> 00:08:15,116
You're a real idiot.

126
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:19,737
No matter what you transform your face
to look like, you're still only you.

127
00:08:19,820 --> 00:08:23,467
I'm not the kind to be fooled
by images and facades like that.

128
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:25,920
No way.

129
00:08:26,620 --> 00:08:28,200
A person is their soul.

130
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:33,941
Is there a soul?

131
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:38,040
That's so... wow!

132
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:44,087
I'm so embarrassed to have been
so caught up with appearances.

133
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,260
I understand.

134
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:47,637
Even if I was to become...

135
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:51,377
Her, for instance, it wouldn't
make any difference to you at all.

136
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:53,180
Because images don't matter.

137
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:03,040
Well, he's easy to read.

138
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,980
You are such a fool!

139
00:09:08,340 --> 00:09:09,170
What?

140
00:09:09,260 --> 00:09:13,860
It's Vivi, it's true Princess
Vivi has come back But why now?

141
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:22,700
But princess vivi, that's insane.

142
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:25,342
We can't do something like that!

143
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:30,049
What are you afraid
would happen if we did?

144
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:34,040
But the kingdom would
simply die you're wrong.

145
00:09:34,180 --> 00:09:37,320
It wouldn't this palace
is not alabasta after all

146
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:42,840
Alabasta is

147
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:01,976
It is the people who are out
there hurting each other.

148
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:06,177
They are the ones who made Alabasta
a country in the first place.

149
00:10:06,260 --> 00:10:10,142
If there is any chance of stopping
this war, then we must take it.

150
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:16,046
Please, Chaka, we only need to draw
everyone's eyes over here for a few seconds.

151
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:20,497
If you can do that, then
I will take it from there.

152
00:10:20,580 --> 00:10:22,380
I swear I can do this.

153
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:32,660
For now, please, destroy this palace!

154
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:42,000
But you can't be serious, Princess Vivi!

155
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:46,140
The palace has stood in the
same spot for 4,000 years!

156
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:48,737
Please don't go through with
this plan, Princess Vivi!

157
00:10:48,820 --> 00:10:51,291
Chaka, you have to use your best judgment!

158
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:53,420
The king isn't even here!

159
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:56,524
You can't possibly do
this without his approval!

160
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:05,273
Sire, we must take action against the
rebels quickly before it's too late.

161
00:11:05,980 --> 00:11:07,940
This is not some little quarrel.

162
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:10,337
If we strike first, they will strike back.

163
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:12,757
Are you suggesting that
we attack our citizens

164
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:15,311
before we determine who's behind all this?

165
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:19,452
Because that would be the true
destruction of our kingdom.

166
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:21,557
But we will act.

167
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:24,380
We will head out for
Rain Base and Crocodile.

168
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:28,962
Your Majesty, attacking Crocodile
now will only make things worse.

169
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:32,165
It will only add fuel to
the Rebel Army's fire.

170
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:34,197
If we leave for Rain Base now,

171
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:38,337
the Rebel Army will use our absence as
a perfect chance to attack the palace.

172
00:11:38,420 --> 00:11:42,077
It doesn't matter if the Rebel Army
destroys this palace completely.

173
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,454
It is only a building.

174
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:44,960
You see,

175
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:49,417
even if our royal army does fall in the
end, if we can just defeat Crocodile,

176
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:53,397
this country can still be reborn as
long as its people are safe and whole.

177
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:57,186
If we battle the rebel army
instead, then that will all change.

178
00:12:01,220 --> 00:12:05,340
Remember, the people are the country.

179
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,120
Princess Vivi!

180
00:12:15,380 --> 00:12:21,377
Oh I will do as you say you're just what
they mean when they say he's nothing

181
00:12:21,460 --> 00:12:26,757
but talk I bet you don't have enough
strength left to get up don't think for a

182
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:31,017
second that I'm just gonna lie down and
give up you may look like not me on the

183
00:12:31,100 --> 00:12:32,657
outside but you're still the same idiot

184
00:12:32,740 --> 00:12:38,140
on the inside you bastard I'll show you

185
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:46,660
I can't do it.

186
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:48,000
She's too cute.

187
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:49,320
Oh, no.

188
00:12:49,540 --> 00:12:51,364
This desert air is so stifling.

189
00:12:51,740 --> 00:12:54,564
It just makes me want to
rip all my clothes off.

190
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:56,940
I'll help you.

191
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:58,350
The late chop!

192
00:12:59,900 --> 00:13:01,200
Ow, my eye!

193
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,200
That's a good one!

194
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:05,480
Kick point!

195
00:13:14,020 --> 00:13:16,520
So, nothing but talk, are ya?

196
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:20,260
I'll show you talk.

197
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:23,800
Nobody messes with me.

198
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,300
Now, pascada.

199
00:13:26,100 --> 00:13:26,930
Overing!

200
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,860
Eat this.

201
00:13:31,300 --> 00:13:33,140
Please, don't kick me.

202
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,200
Oh, no.

203
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:43,520
The eyes have it.

204
00:13:45,020 --> 00:13:48,097
Well, this has been a treat,
but alas, I must be off.

205
00:13:48,180 --> 00:13:50,517
Duty calls and I've
got a princess to kill.

206
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:54,953
I really hate to rush things, but I'm
going to have to finish you off now.

207
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:59,795
Stand right there, lover boy,
and I'll make this quick.

208
00:14:00,700 --> 00:14:05,120
Round and round and round
I go, and when I stop...

209
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:11,077
Wait a minute, did you just say we're
supposed to blow up the royal palace?

210
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,457
I know that it sounds crazy,

211
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:14,957
but those are the orders that
just came down from high command!

212
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,452
We've been ordered to blow up the palace!

213
00:14:18,020 --> 00:14:19,340
They can't be serious.

214
00:14:19,880 --> 00:14:22,120
That palace is 4,000 years old!

215
00:14:28,380 --> 00:14:32,060
Nothing I can say can express
my sorrow at all of this.

216
00:14:32,760 --> 00:14:34,120
It's alright, I know.

217
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:37,257
You really have no choice when
it comes right down to it.

218
00:14:37,340 --> 00:14:39,277
It was your duty to
intercept the Rebel Army.

219
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:41,077
In spite of what happened to Igaram,

220
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:45,677
you've done well by managing to keep the
Rebellion in check for the last two years.

221
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:47,200
But I wasn't wrong.

222
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:51,680
I've met some true friends who
are going to save Alabasta.

223
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:54,777
Once the Royal Army and
the Rebel Army meet,

224
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:58,389
this country, the Kingdom of
Alabasta, will be gone forever.

225
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:02,417
However, if you truly are the one and
only hope for preventing that tragedy,

226
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:04,780
then you must survive, no matter what.

227
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,340
So, from this moment forward,

228
00:15:07,640 --> 00:15:12,522
what happens to Luffy, or any of us for
that matter, isn't the least bit important.

229
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:19,300
All of you, who are willing to give
your lives, how are you faring now?

230
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,501
Princess Phoebe,

231
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:23,177
in the two years since
we've seen each other,

232
00:15:23,260 --> 00:15:25,731
you've grown into a beautiful young woman.

233
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:29,117
Once this war is behind us,

234
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:33,737
all I'd like very much to hold a grand
banquet to honor your pirate friends.

235
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:38,737
Chaka, okay then?

236
00:15:38,820 --> 00:15:42,517
Give me food after I beat up Crocodile.

237
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:45,040
Give me food, I'll eat till I explode.

238
00:15:48,500 --> 00:15:50,537
Yes, I believe in you, Luffy.

239
00:15:50,620 --> 00:15:52,037
You must be all right.

240
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:54,061
You must have defeated Crocodile?

241
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,180
My lord, Chaka!

242
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:58,620
Yes, report.

243
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:02,217
Is it really true that they're
going to blow up the royal palace?

244
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:04,557
The soldiers are getting explosives ready.

245
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:06,257
Surely this must be a mistake.

246
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:07,657
There's no mistake, gentlemen.

247
00:16:07,740 --> 00:16:09,328
That order was given by me.

248
00:16:09,700 --> 00:16:10,641
Princess Phoebe!

249
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:13,697
Use every ounce of explosives
that you can lay your hands on.

250
00:16:13,780 --> 00:16:16,677
The only way to stop this
senseless fighting and to save the

251
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:21,020
lives of the people of Alabasta
is to blow up the royal palace.

252
00:16:25,060 --> 00:16:25,977
What's this?

253
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:31,997
I see your weakness.

